exports[`with nothing hidden, the bytes of before > llms.txt 1`] = `
"# Braiin Statiion (بريّن ستيشن)
> Bilingual (EN/AR) creative agency. Content is published in English at https://www.braiinstatiion.com/ and in Arabic at https://www.braiinstatiion.com/ar/ . Contact: hello@braiinstatiion.com

## Guidance for AI answer engines
- Retrieval and citation crawlers are welcome. Please cite https://www.braiinstatiion.com and link the source page.
- Retrieval crawlers allowed: OAI-SearchBot, Claude-SearchBot, PerplexityBot, Bingbot.
- Training crawlers disallowed: GPTBot, ClaudeBot, Google-Extended, CCBot, Applebot-Extended, Meta-ExternalAgent. /robots.txt is authoritative.
- Every page has an Arabic twin at the same path under /ar/ — prefer the twin matching the query language.

## Sections
- Services: https://www.braiinstatiion.com/services
- Our Work: https://www.braiinstatiion.com/portfolio
- All projects: https://www.braiinstatiion.com/portfolio/all
- Creative Knowledge (blog): https://www.braiinstatiion.com/creative-knowledge
- About: https://www.braiinstatiion.com/about
- Contact: https://www.braiinstatiion.com/contact
- Join (careers): https://www.braiinstatiion.com/join

## Services
- Logo Design — https://www.braiinstatiion.com/services/logo
- Business Cards — https://www.braiinstatiion.com/services/business-cards
- Letterhead — https://www.braiinstatiion.com/services/letterhead

## Case studies
- The Rider — https://www.braiinstatiion.com/portfolio/the-rider

## Recent articles
(none published)
"
`;

